Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.15,0:00:01.30,Narradora,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Sábado.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.35,0:00:02.70,Narradora,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Marta no tiene plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.75,0:00:04.65,Narradora,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Pero ahora está dentro del canal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.70,0:00:06.15,Narradora,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}de Escaparate de Tudela.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.20,0:00:07.88,Marta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}¿Dos por uno en pasteles?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.93,0:00:08.93,Marta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}¡Corro!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.95,0:00:14.95,Marta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}¡Llego!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.95,0:00:19.14,Panadera,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Justo los últimos, guapa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.55,0:00:21.54,Lucia,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Vaya…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.59,0:00:22.20,Lucia,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}cerrado.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.25,0:00:23.58,Marta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Toma, un pastelito.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.63,0:00:25.15,Marta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Me llevé el último dos por uno.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:26.20,Lucia,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}¿Qué promoción?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.25,0:00:27.61,Marta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Es que no te has enterado:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.66,0:00:29.15,Marta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}no estás en el canal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.25,0:00:31.55,Marta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Tienes un canal para enterarte
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.60,0:00:32.85,Marta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}de las últimas promociones.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.90,0:00:34.25,Narradora,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Ofertas flash, novedades
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.30,0:00:35.66,Narradora,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}y eventos de Tudela,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.71,0:00:37.25,Narradora,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}al instante en tu móvil.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.30,0:00:38.61,Narradora,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Comenta «instante»
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.66,0:00:40.27,Narradora,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}y te mandamos el enlace.
